<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Palmer Wireless.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Palmer Wireless.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- J.P. Morgan said it initiated coverage of Palmer Wireless Inc as a market performer and set a 1997 year-end price target of $15 a share.</p>
<p>-- said Palmer has limited growth potential.  Said 1997 will be one of &quot;metamorphosis&quot; for Palmer as it expands its network, reduces per-minute pricing and fights competition.</p>
<p>-- Palmer gained 1/16 to 14-3/4 in morning trading.</p>
</text>
